  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LAIF contribution to the &apos;&apos;Geothermal Development Facility Latin America&quot; Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The general objective of the Programme is to support the development of geothermal energy for electricity generation in Central America and the Andean Region in order to make a significant contribution to lower GHG emission levels and to increase the security of supply.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
